        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"01136f35-a774-480f-9ed0-6075e4bf031f\",\"review_text\":\"Best app for songs\"},{\"review_id\":\"81c589b8-4e22-4e5d-aa91-641004be5744\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"075b8cdd-731b-45ae-8229-c74211803cdc\",\"review_text\":\"This app knows what music I like more than I do!\"},{\"review_id\":\"0c1c8182-5ba2-4195-adad-805d0086acb3\",\"review_text\":\"This is by far the best music app I've ever used. It's very easy to use and I love how you can connect music with family and friends.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ca127e5d-d675-4b7b-a4b9-b8ac4efef8f1\",\"review_text\":\"I think spotify would be better if u were aloud to copy the music and add it to ur youtube videos\"},{\"review_id\":\"ae73d7b8-6ed8-4da7-8cc2-b02d2b29051c\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app very bad experince\"},{\"review_id\":\"a522fc9f-4a4c-48d8-998f-03c394671db8\",\"review_text\":\"Music lover\"},{\"review_id\":\"17718b2f-617c-4349-b0d8-483762eb6cef\",\"review_text\":\"It was the best app but now in 2023 this is the worst i mean seriously worst i hate it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"aa78a9a3-1c90-4c46-9112-25f5b8cd824a\",\"review_text\":\"It is amazing do recommend if love music\"},{\"review_id\":\"e7a0cec2-aa69-466a-a453-96256204521f\",\"review_text\":\"My respect for spotify 📉📉 Soo worst first is was sooo goood but rn it only want to run its app by money huh just some more days your all profits will go down.\"}]}"
